[l_english.EQUIPMENT_TANK_LIGHT_CONTEMPORARY]
Contemporary Light Tank (Light Tank)

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_TANK_LIGHT_CONTEMPORARY_desc]
The contemporary war machine, a marvel of modern engineering and a testament to what happens when you give ponies access to advanced military technology. It is a perfect proctector of harmony, since all non-harmonious things would be obliterated. It’s like the Elements of Harmony, but with a lot more explosions and a slightly lower singing ability.
§g“And we keep telling bad guys, but y’all just don’t seem to remember...”§!

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_TANK_LIGHT_CONTEMPORARY_short]
Contemporary Light Tank

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_TANK_LIGHT_CONTEMPORARY]
轻型现代坦克 (轻型坦克)

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_TANK_LIGHT_CONTEMPORARY_desc]
现代战争机器，现代工程的奇迹，证明了当你给予小马先进的军事技术时会发生什么。它是完美的和谐守护者，因为所有不和谐的东西都会被消灭。就像是和谐之元，但是有更多的爆炸和稍微弱一点的的歌唱能力。
§g“我们一直在告诉坏家伙，但你们似乎就是记不住...”§!

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_TANK_LIGHT_CONTEMPORARY_short]
轻型现代坦克
